{"result": {"id": "e3083c85-c494-4d20-a304-2d6aeb8fba6e", "choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "logprobs": null, "message": {"content": "{\n    \"title\": \"SAP Technology Overview as of 2025\",\n    \"summary\": \"This report provides an overview of SAP's key technologies, highlighting their capabilities, connections, and noteworthy claims. The information is relevant to SAP's operations around 2025.\",\n    \"rating\": 8.5,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The high importance rating reflects the critical roles that SAP Joule and Edge Integration Cell play in supporting SAP's technological advancements, crucial for maintaining the company's operational stability and innovation.\",\n    \"findings\": [\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"SAP Joule Capabilities\",\n            \"explanation\": \"SAP Joule is a natural language query interface used to query data. It supports queries in English and has enhanced accuracy through LLM learning. The interface also supports copying results to a story and opening data analyzer. SAP Joule has been enhanced with new features such as a prompt guide, prompt library, and copy answer to clipboard. It also integrates public information from knowledge-based articles. [Data: Sources (15), Date_Range ((2025, 08, 29), (2025, 09, 12))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Edge Integration Cell Updates\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The Edge Integration Cell has been updated with new features such as software version update, Solace renamed to Messaging Service, update known hosts (SSH) files, and updates on component monitor. The XML Threat Protection policy has also been introduced to safeguard XML-based applications and APIs from malicious attacks. [Data: Sources (111, 112, 113, 114, 115), Date_Range ((2025, 09, 14), (2025, 09, 14))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Decentralized Identity Verification\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Decentralized Identity Verification has been up